  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Joint Peace Initiative Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Somalia Stability Fund Phase 3 (SSF III) takes forward the multi-donor agreement at the 2012 London Conference on Somalia to &#x201c;integrate political, security and development interventions, and respond quickly to emerging opportunities.&#x201d;1 The Fund was designed as a flexible, politically informed, and responsive procurement facility. The SSF III, launched in March 2023, aims to support inclusive political dialogue, address grievances, strengthen local governance, and enhance accountability between citizens and the state. Working collaboratively with Somali authorities, civil society, and international partners is crucial for the success of the project.</narrative>
  </description>
